{"4708840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Atemporal Silentium", "steam_appid": 4708840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708840/extras/d3dbdd8cda4ea52f80ff8b5e9f1bd1df.poster.avif?t=1788187843\" width=600 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708840/extras/d3dbdd8cda4ea52f80ff8b5e9f1bd1df.webm?t=1788187843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708840/extras/d3dbdd8cda4ea52f80ff8b5e9f1bd1df.mp4?t=1788187843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708840/extras/258545e4527c341360c9943838c7a45f.avif?t=1788187843\" width=543 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Atemporal Silentium presents us with a frenetic and rewarding combat system that reminds us of the old classics of the hack-and-slash genre, while preserving the latest features of the genre in the industry. With 3 different weapons to choose from and combine, quick movement sets, and a high skill ceiling, the player is encouraged to experiment and develop their skills to better suit their fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708840/extras/b673e1d766a5208fb073a91